# Cloudflare Pages security headers
# Applied to every URL served from this site.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security: force HTTPS for one year, including subdomains.
# X-Content-Type-Options: block MIME-sniffing.
# X-Frame-Options: deny framing (defense against clickjacking).
# Referrer-Policy: send origin only — no path leak to outbound links.
# Permissions-Policy: disable sensors/mic/camera/geolocation on a static site.
# Content-Security-Policy: tight policy. No scripts, no remote fonts, no third-party
# loads. Inline styles are restricted to the data: SVG favicon only.

/
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Caching
#
# A `_headers` rule matches on PATH ONLY (the query string is ignored), and a
# bare `/` matches the root document alone -- every other URL previously fell
# through to Cloudflare's defaults with nothing stated here.
#
# HTML and the generated JSON feeds must revalidate on every view, or a status
# page can show yesterday's numbers. The stylesheet is the opposite case: its
# URL now carries a content hash (see scripts/site/stamp_asset_versions.py), so
# a given URL's bytes never change and it is safe to cache hard. Caching it
# hard is also the point -- an unversioned, long-lived stylesheet cache is what
# served stale CSS to a live visitor on 2026-08-18.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/styles.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
